{"title": "Mysterious Liquid", "pageid": 3821, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Mysterious_Liquid", "categories": ["Surfaces", "Areas"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div style=\"min-height: 200px\" class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Mysterious_Liquid_surface.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/92/Mysterious_Liquid_surface.png/300px-Mysterious_Liquid_surface.png.webp, /w/images/9/92/Mysterious_Liquid_surface.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Mysterious Liquid image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/92/Mysterious_Liquid_surface.png/300px-Mysterious_Liquid_surface.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/92/Mysterious_Liquid_surface.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Mysterious Liquid</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Surface\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Surface\">surface</a> created by breaking a <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Nautiloid_Tank\" title=\"Nautiloid Tank\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cb/Nautiloid_Tank_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Nautiloid_Tank_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/cb/Nautiloid_Tank_Unfaded_Icon.png/38px-Nautiloid_Tank_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/cb/Nautiloid_Tank_Unfaded_Icon.png/50px-Nautiloid_Tank_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cb/Nautiloid_Tank_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Nautiloid_Tank_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/cb/Nautiloid_Tank_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Nautiloid_Tank\" title=\"Nautiloid Tank\">Nautiloid Tank</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p>This vivid, briny fluid reacts to any heat that comes near it.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<dl class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/25px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/38px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Condition Type Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/25px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Type: <a href=\"/wiki/Area#Surface\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Area\">Surface</a></dd>\n\n</dl>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Creation\">Creation</span></h2>\n<p>This area can be created by the following:\n</p><p>Items:\n</p>\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r347748\">.mw-parser-output .div-col{margin-top:0.3em;column-width:20em}.mw-parser-output .div-col>ul{list-style-type:inherit}.mw-parser-output .div-col-rules{column-rule:1px solid #aaa}.mw-parser-output .div-col dl,.mw-parser-output .div-col ol,.mw-parser-output .div-col ul{margin-top:0}.mw-parser-output .div-col li,.mw-parser-output .div-col dd{page-break-inside:avoid;break-inside:avoid-column}</style><div class=\"div-col\"><ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Nautiloid_Tank\" title=\"Nautiloid Tank\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cb/Nautiloid_Tank_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Nautiloid_Tank_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/cb/Nautiloid_Tank_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Nautiloid_Tank_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/cb/Nautiloid_Tank_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Nautiloid_Tank_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cb/Nautiloid_Tank_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Nautiloid_Tank_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/cb/Nautiloid_Tank_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Nautiloid_Tank\" title=\"Nautiloid Tank\">Nautiloid Tank</a></span></li>\n</ul></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Interactions\">Interactions</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Explodes when exposed to <a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\">fire</a> damage, inflicting <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Burning_(Condition)\" title=\"Burning (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Burning_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Burning_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Burning_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Burning\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Burning_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Burning_(Condition)\" title=\"Burning (Condition)\">Burning</a> to entities within the area and leaving behind a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fire_(surface)\" title=\"Fire (surface)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cb/Fire_surface_Icon.webp/25px-Fire_surface_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/cb/Fire_surface_Icon.webp/38px-Fire_surface_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/cb/Fire_surface_Icon.webp/50px-Fire_surface_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fire\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cb/Fire_surface_Icon.webp/25px-Fire_surface_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/cb/Fire_surface_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Fire_(surface)\" title=\"Fire (surface)\">Fire</a> surface.</li></ul>\n\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202012\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.054 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.059 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1500/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 12754/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 4521/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 491/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.010/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 930497/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   52.266      1 Template:Area_page\n100.00%   52.266      1 -total\n 40.30%   21.062      4 Template:Main_namespace_only\n 34.86%   18.218      1 Template:PageSeo\n 34.31%   17.931      1 Template:Hidden_code\n 33.77%   17.649      2 Template:Item_icon\n 25.63%   13.397      1 Template:RarityItem\n 16.75%    8.756      6 Template:Ifempty\n 13.61%    7.115      1 Template:Cond\n 13.22%    6.908      1 Template:Area\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 